-      repetition_penalty: "Makes notes used in the recent window less likely (default 1.005, almost off). " +
-        "The planner rarely loops, so leave it.",
-      penalty_window: "How many recent tokens the repetition penalty looks back over (default 100).",
-      min_tokens: "The score cannot end before this many tokens (default 32).",
-      max_tokens: "The longest score, in tokens (default 6144: 4096 cut long scores short; 8192 leaves the lyrics too little room). A score cut off here cannot be used."
+      temperature: "Randomness of the score planner. Default 0.7.\n" +
+        "✓ 0.6–0.8 for a song with a firm structure; 0.85–0.95 when the melodies sound stock.\n" +
+        "⚠ Above 1.0 bars break and sections go missing, and a broken score cannot be used. " +
+        "0 is greedy: the same phrase over and over.",
+      top_p: "Keeps only the most likely next notes, up to this share of the total chance. Default 0.9.\n" +
+        "✓ 0.85–0.95.\n" +
+        "⚠ Below 0.7 the melody turns monotone. 1.0 switches it off and lets rare, broken tokens through.",
